  'tour.s.sidebar.body': 'Everything is grouped here: Certificates, Monitoring, Alerts, Reports, Logs and (if you have access) Admin. Click a group heading to open it; the collapse button shrinks the menu to icons.',
  'tour.s.dashboard.title': 'Dashboard counters',
  'tour.s.dashboard.body': 'The fleet at a glance: valid, warning, critical, error. Click a counter and the cards below are filtered to that state.',
  'tour.s.filters.title': 'Sorting and filters',
  'tour.s.filters.body': 'Narrow the cards by status, expiry window, team and search. Filters are written to the address bar, so a shared link opens the same view.',
  'tour.s.check-now.title': 'Check Now',
  'tour.s.check-now.body': 'Re-checks every certificate (or just the team you pick) straight away, without waiting for the scheduled sweep; progress shows in a window.',
  'tour.s.add-domain.title': 'Add a domain',
  'tour.s.add-domain.body': 'Type a domain and use "SSL Checker" to see its certificate immediately, then add it to the inventory. The inventory record carries team, tier and contact details.',
  'tour.s.card.title': 'Certificate card',
  'tour.s.card.body': 'Each card summarises one domain\'s certificate: days left, issuer, team and last check. Click the card to open the detail window.',
  'tour.s.modal.title': 'Detail window',
  'tour.s.modal.body': 'Tabs: SSL check, health, details, check history, alert history, chart, inventory and notes. Esc closes it.',
  'tour.s.all.title': 'All Certificates',
  'tour.s.all.body': 'The table view: column picker, sortable headings, multi-dimensional filters, bulk actions and CSV. The main workspace for large fleets.',
  'tour.s.monitoring.title': 'Monitoring',
  'tour.s.monitoring.body': 'HTTP, domain, port, DNS, keyword, ping, page, page speed and scripted monitors. Every page has a "How to fill in" guide.',
  'tour.s.alerts.title': 'Alerts and incidents',
  'tour.s.alerts.body': 'Open incidents, maintenance windows and alert history live here. Click an incident to jump to the monitor it belongs to.',
  'tour.s.reports.title': 'Reports',
  'tour.s.reports.body': 'Statistics, the weak-algorithm report, weekly reports and outage history. Weekly reports are filled in per team and sent by email.',
  'tour.s.admin.title': 'Admin',
  'tour.s.admin.body': 'Users, teams, permissions, inventory and settings. Every change lands in the audit log.',
  'tour.s.health.title': 'System Health',
  'tour.s.health.body': 'Scheduler, database, memory, user and session activity and configuration health on one screen.',
  'tour.s.audit.title': 'Audit log',
  'tour.s.audit.body': 'Who changed what, and when — filterable and exportable.',
  'tour.s.palette.title': 'Command palette',
  'tour.s.palette.body': 'Ctrl K: type a page, certificate, monitor or team name and press Enter. The fastest way around from the keyboard.',
  'tour.s.inbox.title': 'Notifications',
  'tour.s.inbox.body': 'Incidents assigned to you, upcoming expiries and announcements gather here; the counter drops as you read them.',
  'tour.s.user.title': 'User menu',
  'tour.s.user.body': 'Last sign-in details, device history, password change and the option to restart this tour.',
  'tour.s.theme.title': 'Theme and language',
  'tour.s.theme.body': 'Dark or light theme and a Turkish or English interface. Your choice is kept in this browser.',
  'tour.s.help.title': 'Help',
  'tour.s.help.body': 'The "?" in the bottom-right corner opens the guide section for the page you are on; the full guide is under Help.',
  'tour.s.done.title': 'You\'re all set',
  'tour.s.done.body': 'Restart the tour any time from the user menu or the command palette ("Product tour"). The getting-started list on the dashboard walks you through the first steps.',
  'tour.s.all-filters.title': 'Filters',
  'tour.s.all-filters.body': 'Domain and issuer search, team, expiry window, tier, insecure and port filters. Active filters show as chips; ✕ removes one.',
  'tour.s.all-status.title': 'Status filter',
  'tour.s.all-status.body': 'The menu in the heading shows how many records sit at each level; the choice is applied on the server.',
  'tour.s.all-columns.title': 'Columns',
  'tour.s.all-columns.body': 'Switch on any of the 21 columns and drag to reorder. The choice is kept in this browser.',
  'tour.s.all-presets.title': 'Presets',
  'tour.s.all-presets.body': 'Save a filter + column + sort combination under a name; copy the link to share it.',
  'tour.s.all-csv.title': 'CSV',
  'tour.s.all-csv.body': 'Downloads every page with the same filters and the visible columns; the export is audited.',
  'tour.s.all-select.title': 'Row selection',
  'tour.s.all-select.body': 'Select rows to open the bulk bar: check now, set tier or team, deactivate, export the selection.',
  'tour.s.all-menu.title': 'Row menu',
  'tour.s.all-menu.body': 'Details, check now, alert or check history (straight to that tab), the inventory record and copy link.',
  'tour.s.mon-how.title': 'How does it work?',
  'tour.s.mon-how.body': 'This box explains where and how the monitor runs (interval, timeout, proxy).',
  'tour.s.mon-new.title': 'New monitor',
  'tour.s.mon-new.body': 'Opens the form; Save stays disabled while required fields are empty. "Test" tries it without saving.',
  'tour.s.mon-guide.title': 'How to fill in',
  'tour.s.mon-guide.body': 'A field-by-field guide with examples.',
  'tour.s.mon-cards.title': 'Monitor cards',
  'tour.s.mon-cards.body': 'Status, last response time and a mini trend. Click a card for its check and alert history.',
