  'keyword.cacheBustExamples': 'Examples (only needed if the endpoint sits behind a cache/CDN):\n• URL has no ? yet → https://site.com/api/data?v={timestamp}\n• URL already has ? → https://site.com/api?env=prod&v={timestamp}\n• Health endpoint → https://site.com/health?nocache={timestamp}\n• Header (one per line) → Cache-Control: no-cache  (add Pragma: no-cache if needed)\n• Most reliable: {timestamp} + Cache-Control together. If not cached, leave both empty.',
